    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-stop action just for you</strong></h2>You can't simply stop fighting. Enter the Dungeons again and again. And again... and even one more time. Go now<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/6d407d5a8f138ebf33a21ba0ccd96368.poster.avif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/6d407d5a8f138ebf33a21ba0ccd96368.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/6d407d5a8f138ebf33a21ba0ccd96368.mp4?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We celebrate diversity</strong></h2> Not all Dungeons are equal, but we respect the Monsters who call them home. You are on equal footing with all creatures, but perhaps a tad more equal, because you wield the sword!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/60f1d9890a294d25cd20e4d12d3ad80e.poster.avif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/60f1d9890a294d25cd20e4d12d3ad80e.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not just another form of customization</strong></h2> Some change their clothes, others their weapons. You, however, can excel by changing your very body. A new body means new skills!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/82b9e9d98c715bdb59e4d36c58aa6bd1.poster.avif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/82b9e9d98c715bdb59e4d36c58aa6bd1.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/82b9e9d98c715bdb59e4d36c58aa6bd1.mp4?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worship and appease your God</strong></h2>There is a purpose. Maybe you won't grasp it at first. You don't have to. Fight and satisfy the God. No further information is needed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/c27abc91868a930de9803deb37c1c142.poster.avif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/c27abc91868a930de9803deb37c1c142.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
