vif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/82b9e9d98c715bdb59e4d36c58aa6bd1.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/82b9e9d98c715bdb59e4d36c58aa6bd1.mp4?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worship and appease your God</strong></h2>There is a purpose. Maybe you won't grasp it at first. You don't have to. Fight and satisfy the God. No further information is needed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/c27abc91868a930de9803deb37c1c142.poster.avif?t=1752496423\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606210/extras/c27abc91868a930de9803deb37c1c142.webm?t=1752496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Explore the deepest Dungeons in this thrilling roguelike action game. Collect souls in the name of the evil God. Fall and come back again and again because it's your destiny to serve for eternity. Stay alive in these challenging missions, or die and rise for more!",
